sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as RagController (诊断端点)
    participant P as RagPipeline
    participant OR as ObsDocumentRetriever
    participant R as MinimalReferenceRetriever
    participant ORe as ObsReRanker
    participant Re as MinimalReferenceReRanker
    participant RM as RagMetrics → MetricsRegistry
    participant OT as OpenTelemetry (GlobalOpenTelemetry)

    Note over C,ORe: 端到端检索 + 重排（retrieveAndRerank）

    C->>P: retrieveAndRerank(query, topK)
    P->>OR: retrieve(query, topK)

    OR->>OT: startSpan("RAG:retrieve")  (解析 AgentSpanContext)
    OT-->>OR: Span
    OR->>R: retrieve(query, topK)
    R-->>OR: List~RagDocument~ (已打分 score)
    OR->>RM: recordTimer("rag.retrieval.latency", ms)
    OR->>RM: recordSummary("rag.retrieval.documents", docCount)
    OR->>RM: recordSummary("rag.retrieval.hit_rate", hitRate)
    OR->>OT: span.end()
    OR-->>P: 候选 docs

    P->>ORe: rerank(query, candidates, topK)
    ORe->>OT: startSpan("RAG:rerank")  (解析 AgentSpanContext)
    ORe->>Re: rerank(query, candidates, topK)
    Re-->>ORe: List~RagDocument~ (重排后 topK)
    ORe->>RM: recordTimer("rag.rerank.latency", ms)
    ORe->>RM: recordSummary("rag.topk.relevance", meanTopKScore)
    ORe->>OT: span.end()
    ORe-->>P: 最终 top-K docs

    P-->>C: RagRetrieveResult(query, topK, docs, latencies, hitRate, topKRelevance)

    Note over OR: 异常路径（与 ObsChatModel 一致：try/catch 包 metrics，span 标错并 end，不吞异常）
    rect rgb(255,240,240)
        OR->>R: retrieve(...)
        R-->>OR: throw RuntimeException
        OR->>RM: recordCounter("rag.retrieval.error", retriever, error_type)
        OR->>OT: span.setStatus(ERROR); span.recordException(e); span.end()
        OR-->>P: re-throw
    end
